## DO NOT

- DO NOT widen `W44_124_DCT32_KEEP_AUTO_MAX_DISTANCE` above 3.5 without
  re-measuring. W44-134 measured -0.64 to -1.43 SSIM2 regression at
  d=4 — widening to 4.0 re-introduces that cluster.
- DO NOT lower `W44_124_DCT32_KEEP_AUTO_MIN_DISTANCE` below 2.0 without
  re-measuring. W44-134 measured -0.41 to -0.52 SSIM2 regression at
  d=0.8/1.0 — lowering to 1.0 re-introduces that cluster.
- DO NOT touch W44-124 m3+ed thresholds (60.0 / 0.05). They are
  load-bearing for rejecting imessage/terminal/photos.
- DO NOT remove the W44-135 distance gate as a "fix" for the residual
  codec_wiki e6/e7 d=4 cells — those are W44-110 baseline cells that
  did not improve under W44-124; they need a different mechanism.
- DO NOT cite FMA precision (RULED OUT 2026-05-19).

## Reproducer

```
cd ~/work/zen/jxl-encoder
CARGO_TARGET_DIR=$HOME/work/zen/jxl-encoder-shared-target \
  cargo run -p jxl-encoder --release \
  --features 'parallel butteraugli-loop ssim2-loop' \
  --example w44_135_distance_gate_ab
```

